WEBVTT

00:01:57.679 --> 00:02:00.320
than not to be Amy
the hurt five year-old little sister,

00:02:00.344 --> 00:02:01.776
but Amy the special unicorn.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.924
Of course, this option
was open to her brain

00:02:03.948 --> 00:02:05.132
at no point in the past.

00:02:05.156 --> 00:02:08.253
And you could see how my poor,
manipulated sister faced conflict,

00:02:08.277 --> 00:02:10.654
as her little brain attempted
to devote resources

00:02:10.678 --> 00:02:13.977
to feeling the pain and suffering
and surprise she just experienced,

00:02:14.001 --> 00:02:16.546
or contemplating her new-found
identity as a unicorn.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:17.676
And the latter won.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.539
Instead of crying or ceasing our play,

00:02:19.563 --> 00:02:20.976
instead of waking my parents,

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.307
with all the negative consequences for me,

00:02:23.331 --> 00:02:24.976
a smile spread across her face

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.092
and she scrambled back up
onto the bunk bed

00:02:27.116 --> 00:02:29.002
with all the grace of a baby unicorn --

00:02:29.026 --> 00:02:31.555
(Laughter)